# API Key Configuration for Concurrent Aider Sessions
# 
# This file contains multiple Google/Gemini API keys for concurrent aider sessions.
# Each aider session will be assigned a different key to avoid rate limiting.
#
# Format options:
# 1. Numbered keys (recommended for concurrent sessions):
#    GOOGLE_API_KEY_1=your_first_api_key_here
#    GOOGLE_API_KEY_2=your_second_api_key_here
#    GOOGLE_API_KEY_3=your_third_api_key_here
#
# 2. Single key (all sessions share one key):
#    GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_single_api_key_here
#
# 3. Alternative naming (GEMINI_API_KEY instead of GOOGLE_API_KEY):
#    GEMINI_API_KEY_1=your_first_api_key_here
#    GEMINI_API_KEY_2=your_second_api_key_here

# Example numbered keys for concurrent sessions:
GOOGLE_API_KEY_1=your_google_api_key_1_here
GOOGLE_API_KEY_2=your_google_api_key_2_here
GOOGLE_API_KEY_3=your_google_api_key_3_here

# Or use single key if you only have one:
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_single_api_key_here
